#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:358
#, python-brace-format
msgid "bg_method を tophat、tophat_se_size を {se} にして解析し直してください。"
msgstr "Analyze again with bg_method set to tophat and tophat_se_size set to {se}."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:360
msgid "tophat は走査線ごとの高さの段差を trendfill ほど取り除かないため、補正後の画像に横縞が残ることがあります。"
msgstr " tophat removes less of the height steps between scan lines than trendfill, so horizontal stripes may remain in the calibrated image."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:364
#, python-brace-format
msgid "bg_method を {method} にして解析し直してください。"
msgstr "Analyze again with bg_method set to {method}."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:367
msgid "補正後の画像で、繊維が残っているか確かめてください。"
msgstr "Check on the calibrated image that the fibers are still there."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:370
#, python-brace-format
msgid "警告: {name}: 大半の繊維で見かけ幅を測れなかったため、背景補正の検査を行えませんでした。補正が繊維を取り除いた場合もこの状態になります。"
msgstr ""
"Warning: {name}: no apparent width could be measured for most fibers, so "
"the background calibration could not be checked. A calibration that "
"removed the fibers also leaves this state. "

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:375
#, python-brace-format
msgid "警告: {name}: 繊維の起伏の {fraction:.0%} が、すぐ脇の背景より高い背景として引かれており、繊維の高さが低く出ています。"
msgstr ""
"Warning: {name}: {fraction:.0%} of the fibers' relief was subtracted as "
"background standing above the background beside them, so fiber heights "
"read low. "

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:380
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"警告: {name}: 繊維の見かけ幅（中央値 {width:.1f} px）に対して tophat_se_size "
"が小さく、繊維の高さが低く出ているおそれがあります。"
msgstr ""
"Warning: {name}: tophat_se_size is small for the fibers' apparent width "
"(median {width:.1f} px), so fiber heights may read low. "

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:385
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"警告: {name}: 繊維の斜面の段差がノイズに比べて小さく（斜面段差比 {ratio:.2f}、{method} の目安は {limit:g}"
" 以上）、{method} が繊維の一部を背景として引いて高さが低く出ているおそれがあります。"
msgstr ""
"Warning: {name}: the fibers' flanks step little against the noise (flank-"
"step ratio {ratio:.2f}; {method} needs {limit:g} or more), so {method} "
"may have subtracted part of each fiber as background and fiber heights "
"may read low. "

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:392
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"警告: {name}: 繊維の見かけ幅（中央値 {width:.1f} px）が、{method} を確かめた範囲（{limit:g} px "
"まで）を超えており、繊維の高さが低く出ているおそれがあります。"
msgstr ""
"Warning: {name}: the fibers' apparent width (median {width:.1f} px) is "
"above the range {method} was checked to (up to {limit:g} px), so fiber "
"heights may read low. "

