msgid "BGCalibrator"
msgstr "BGCalibrator"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4404
msgid "bg_method"
msgstr "bg_method"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4405
msgid "背景推定方式（下の説明参照）。選択に応じて使うパラメータのみ有効化されます"
msgstr ""
"Background estimation method (see descriptions below). Only the "
"parameters used by the selected method are enabled."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4411
msgid ""
"trendfill : 勾配リッジ検出 + 2次トレンド除去 + "
"最近傍充填。勾配で繊維マスクを作り、試料傾斜を2次曲面で除いてから穴を埋める。汎用だがリッジ検出パラメータの調整が必要（1.0.0 では "
"'inpaint' という名前）"
msgstr ""
"trendfill: gradient ridge detection + second-order trend removal + "
"nearest-background fill. Creates a fiber mask from gradients, removes the"
" sample tilt with a second-order surface, then fills the holes. General-"
"purpose, but the ridge-detection parameters need tuning (named 'inpaint' "
"in 1.0.0)."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4412
msgid ""
"tophat : 形態学的opening。tophat_se_size "
"より細い明るい構造を前景として除去。マスク不要・高速。拡大して撮った画像など、繊維が多くの画素にまたがる画像では他の方式より高さを保ちやすい。そのときは"
" tophat_se_size を繊維の見かけ幅の約3倍にする（解析後、必要ならログに推奨値を表示）"
msgstr ""
"tophat : morphological opening. Removes bright structures narrower than "
"tophat_se_size as the foreground. No mask needed; fast. On scans whose "
"fibers span many pixels, such as a small area imaged at a fine pixel "
"size, it keeps fiber heights better than the other methods; then set "
"tophat_se_size to about three times the fibers' apparent width (after the"
" analysis the log shows a suggested value when one is needed)"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4413
msgid ""
"spline1d : 2次トレンド除去 + 行/列ごとの1D "
"B-スプライン補間。ライン端は外挿せず自ラインの水準を保持。spline1d_axis "
"で補間の向きを選択。'x'(既定)では、画像の行が走査ラインのとき走査ラインごとの上下のずれ(横縞)も除去"
msgstr ""
"spline1d: second-order trend removal + 1D B-spline interpolation by "
"row/column. The line ends hold that line's own level instead of "
"extrapolating. spline1d_axis selects the interpolation direction; with "
"'x' (default), when the image rows are the scan lines, the up/down offset"
" of each scan line (horizontal stripes) is removed as well."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4426
msgid "[tophat時のみ] 構造要素直径"
msgstr "[tophat only] Structuring element diameter"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4427
msgid "最大ファイバー幅の2〜3倍。奇数(偶数は+1)"
msgstr ""
"Set to 2-3 times the maximum fiber width. Use an odd number (even values "
"are incremented by 1)."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4430
msgid ""
"[spline1d時のみ] "
"補間の向き。'x'=各行を横に補間し、画像の行が走査ラインのときは走査ラインごとの上下のずれ(横縞)も除去。'y'=各列を縦に補間し、横縞は除去しない"
msgstr ""
"[spline1d only] Interpolation direction. 'x' interpolates each row "
"horizontally and, when the image rows are the scan lines, also removes "
"the up/down offset of each scan line (horizontal stripes). 'y' "
"interpolates each column vertically and does not remove horizontal "
"stripes."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4433
msgid "[spline1d時のみ] 行/列スプライン order。実用範囲1〜3 (2=旧pandas互換)。点数不足の行は線形に自動フォールバック"
msgstr ""
"[spline1d only] Row/column spline order. Practical range is 1-3 (2 = "
"legacy pandas-compatible). Rows with too few points automatically fall "
"back to linear fitting."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4436
msgid "[trendfill, spline1d時] 背景範囲（中心±sigma*係数）を決める係数"
msgstr ""
"[trendfill, spline1d] Factor that determines the background range (center"
" ± sigma * factor)."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4438
msgid "[trendfill, spline1d時] [1,0,-1]の急変を繊維として除外する距離しきい値"
msgstr ""
"[trendfill, spline1d] Distance threshold for excluding sudden changes "
"such as [1,0,-1] as fibers"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4440
msgid "[trendfill, spline1d時] [1,-1]の急変が一定以上離れている場合に構造とみなすしきい値"
msgstr ""
"[trendfill, spline1d] Threshold for treating [1,-1] sudden changes as "
"structures when they are separated by at least this distance"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4443
msgid ""
"[trendfill, tophat, spline1d時] Savitzky-Golayフィルタの窓幅（平滑化範囲）。spline1d "
"ではライン端に保持する水準の平均本数も兼ねる"
msgstr ""
"[trendfill, tophat, spline1d] Savitzky-Golay filter window length "
"(smoothing range). With spline1d it also sets how many samples are "
"averaged for the level held at the line ends."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4445
msgid "[trendfill, tophat, spline1d時] Savitzky-Golayフィルタの多項式次数"
msgstr "[trendfill, tophat, spline1d] Savitzky-Golay filter polynomial order"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4448
msgid "中央値フィルタを最後にかける（点ノイズに強い）"
msgstr "Apply median filter at the end (robust against point noise)"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4451
msgid "[trendfill, spline1d時] 繊維マスクを膨張させる画素数（0でdilationなし）"
msgstr ""
"[trendfill, spline1d] Number of pixels to dilate the fiber mask (0 = no "
"dilation)"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4453
msgid "[trendfill, spline1d時] dilation前にマスクから除外する連結成分の最小面積"
msgstr ""
"[trendfill, spline1d] Minimum connected-component area to exclude from "
"the mask before dilation"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4454
msgid "1でフィルタ無効"
msgstr "1 disables the filter"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4464
msgid "Segmenter"
msgstr "Segmenter"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4465
msgid "局所しきい値の計算に使う窓サイズ"
msgstr "Window size used for local threshold calculation"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4466
msgid "全体一律の2値化しきい値"
msgstr "Global binarization threshold"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4467
msgid "小さい連結成分を消す面積しきい値"
msgstr "Area threshold to remove small connected components"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4468
msgid "つながり成分を除くときの面積しきい値"
msgstr "Area threshold for removing connected components"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4469
msgid "つながり除去を実行するかどうか"
msgstr "Whether to perform connected component removal"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4477
msgid "線分検出で線分とみなす最小長さ"
msgstr "Minimum length to consider as a line segment in line detection"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4478
msgid "線っぽさ"
msgstr "Line-likeness"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4478
msgid "のしきい値"
msgstr "threshold"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4479
msgid "高さが低い成分を消すしきい値"
msgstr "Height threshold to remove low-height components"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4481
msgid "しきい値で拾えなかった繊維をリッジフィルタで検出して追加する。1画像あたり数秒〜30秒遅くなる"
msgstr ""
"Detect fibers the threshold missed with a ridge filter and add them. Adds"
" a few seconds to 30 seconds per image"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4484
msgid "[ridge_recovery時] 追加するセグメントの最小長"
msgstr "[ridge_recovery] Minimum length of an added segment"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4486
msgid "[ridge_recovery時] リッジフィルタが探索する繊維半幅の下限"
msgstr ""
"[ridge_recovery] Lower bound of the fiber half-width searched by the "
"ridge filter"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4488
msgid "[ridge_recovery時] リッジフィルタが探索する繊維半幅の上限"
msgstr ""
"[ridge_recovery] Upper bound of the fiber half-width searched by the "
"ridge filter"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4490
msgid "Skeletonizer"
msgstr "Skeletonizer"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4491
msgid "分岐点が低い高さか判定するしきい値"
msgstr "Threshold to determine if a branch point has low height"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4492
msgid "枝とみなす短い線を追跡する最大長"
msgstr "Maximum length to track short lines considered as branches"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4493
msgid "小さすぎる線分（ノイズ）を削除する面積しきい値"
msgstr "Area threshold to remove too-small line segments (noise)"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4494
