"based, so adjust for the scan resolution. 0 disables"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4497
msgid "Kinkdetector"
msgstr "Kinkdetector"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4498
msgid "折れ線近似の3点のなす角がこの値以下ならkink判定"
msgstr ""
"Kink is detected if the angle formed by three points in polyline "
"approximation is below this value"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4510
msgid ""
"キンク判定と、長さ・高さ・曲率などすべての計測に使う中心線（W は繊維の見かけ幅）\n"
"half_max_025w：高さ断面の半値中点、W/4 で平滑化（既定）\n"
"half_max_05w：半値中点、0.5W で平滑化\n"
"skeleton_pixels：スケルトン画素そのもの\n"
"smoothed_skeleton_05w / 1w：スケルトンを 0.5W / 1W で平滑化\n"
"quarter_max：1/4 高さの中点\n"
"centroid：高さの重心\n"
"crest：断面の頂点（ねじれた繊維では軸から最も外れる）"
msgstr ""
"Centerline used for kink detection and for every measurement, including "
"length, height, and curvature (W is the fiber's apparent width)\n"
"half_max_025w: half-maximum midpoint of the height cross-section, "
"smoothed over W/4 (default)\n"
"half_max_05w: half-maximum midpoint, smoothed over 0.5W\n"
"skeleton_pixels: the skeleton pixels themselves\n"
"smoothed_skeleton_05w / 1w: the skeleton smoothed over 0.5W / 1W\n"
"quarter_max: quarter-height midpoint\n"
"centroid: height centroid\n"
"crest: cross-section crest (moves farthest off the axis on twisted fibers)"

