#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{fiber} 集計は、同じ画像・同じフォルダのファイバーを独立な標本として検定しています。p "
"値は試料の数ではなくファイバー本数とともに小さくなります。1 フォルダが 1 試料なら、試料間の差は {folder} 集計で検定してください。"
msgstr ""
"{fiber} aggregation tests the fibers of one image and of one folder as "
"independent samples, so the p-value shrinks with the number of fibers "
"rather than the number of specimens. If each folder holds one specimen, "
"test a difference between specimens with {folder} aggregation."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:688
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{image} 集計は、同じフォルダの画像を独立な標本として検定しています。p 値は試料の数ではなく画像枚数とともに小さくなります。1 フォルダが"
" 1 試料なら、試料間の差は {folder} 集計で検定してください。"
msgstr ""
"{image} aggregation tests the images of one folder as independent "
"samples, so the p-value shrinks with the number of images rather than the"
" number of specimens. If each folder holds one specimen, test a "
"difference between specimens with {folder} aggregation."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:744
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"次のペアは、同じ値が無ければ 2 群が完全に分かれても p 値が {alpha} 未満になりません（値はこの標本数で到達しうる最小の p 値）: "
"{pairs}。これらのペアの「有意差なし」は、差が無いことを示しません。"
msgstr ""
"Without equal values, the following pairs cannot reach p < {alpha} even "
"when the two groups do not overlap at all (each value is the smallest "
"p-value attainable at these sample sizes): {pairs}. For these pairs, "
"\"not significant\" does not show that there is no difference."

