msgid "数値を保存"
msgstr "Save Values"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1497
msgid "入力"
msgstr "Input"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1506
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{bundle} は GUI01 が出力した .b2z を直接読み、全ての集計単位が使えます。{csv} は Fiber Tracker "
"が出力した {suffix} "
"を読み、そこに残っているファイバーだけを集計します。密なネットワークでは自動フィルターでゴミを落とせないため、Fiber Tracker "
"で全体像を見ながら除外し、その結果を集計するのがこの経路の目的です。{csv} はファイバー単位の値しか持たないため、{pixel} と "
"{length} 集計は使えません。"
msgstr ""
"{bundle} reads GUI01's .b2z directly and supports every aggregation unit."
" {csv} reads the {suffix} files exported by the Fiber Tracker and "
"aggregates only the fibers left in them. Automatic filters cannot drop "
"debris in a dense network, so the point of this path is to exclude "
"objects while looking at the overview in the Fiber Tracker and then "
"aggregate what survived. {csv} holds per-fiber values only, so the "
"{pixel} and {length} units are unavailable."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1520
msgid "除外を適用"
msgstr "Apply exclusions"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1526
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"バンドル横の {suffix} に記録された手動除外を適用します。Fiber Tracker "
"で除外したファイバーが集計から外れ、何本外れたかはログに出ます。OFF にすると、追跡された全てのファイバーを集計します。"
msgstr ""
"Apply the manual exclusions recorded in {suffix} beside the bundle. "
"Fibers excluded in the Fiber Tracker drop out of the aggregation, and the"
" log reports how many. Turn this off to aggregate every traced fiber."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1533
msgid "連結を適用"
msgstr "Apply connection"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1539
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"バンドル横の {suffix} に記録された連結結果を適用します。Fiber Tracker で連結して保存したバンドルは、そこで見ていたのと同じ"
" 1 "
"本のフィブリルとして集計されます。自動連結と手動連結は区別されません。記録されているのはどの断片が繋がっているかであり、探索はここでは実行されないため、集計対象は画面で確認したものと一致します。ファイルの無いバンドルは骨格断片のまま集計されるため、適用できた枚数はログに出ます。"
msgstr ""
"Apply the connection result recorded in the {suffix} file beside each "
"bundle. A bundle connected and saved in the Fiber Tracker is aggregated "
"as the same whole fibrils shown there. Automatic and manual connections "
"are not distinguished. What is recorded is which fragments are joined, "
"and no search runs here, so what is aggregated matches what you checked "
"on screen. A bundle with no file is aggregated as skeleton fragments, so "
"the log reports how many bundles the connection could be applied to."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1555
msgid "計測量"
msgstr "Quantity"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1564
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"比較する形態パラメータを選びます。いずれもファイバー追跡の結果から算出します。{height} "
"は追跡された点の高さをそのまま集めるため走査範囲が未記録のバンドルでも計測できますが、{length} / {angle} / {density}"
" はバンドルに走査範囲が記録されている必要があります。"
msgstr ""
"Choose the morphological parameter to compare. All of them are derived "
"from fiber tracking. {height} collects the heights of the tracked points "
"as they are, so it also works on a bundle with no recorded scan size, "
"while {length} / {angle} / {density} need the bundle to have one."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1573
msgid "集計単位"
msgstr "Sample unit"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1583
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"1 標本の数え方を選びます。{pixel} は骨格画素 1 点、{kink} はキンク 1 点、{fiber} はファイバー 1 "
"本（高さはファイバー内の中央値）、{image} は画像 1 枚、{folder} は登録フォルダ 1 つです。{image} と "
"{folder} "
"は含まれるファイバー値の中央値で、キンク角は全キンクの角度の中央値、キンク密度は総キンク数を判定した長さの合計で割った値です。{pixel} "
"でまとめた分布は独立観測ではなく、長いファイバーほど重みが大きくなるため、群間比較では {fiber}・{image}・{folder} "
"でも確認してください。1 フォルダが 1 試料なら、試料間の差を検定する単位は {folder} です。{length} "
"は骨格画素を輪郭長で重み付けします。画素を等しく数えると、斜めの骨格ステップが約 1.41 "
"倍長いことと、走査範囲の異なる画像でピクセルサイズが変わることの 2 つの偏りが入ります。{length} "
"は両方を取り除き、「観測した輪郭長のうちの割合」を表す走査条件に依らない分布にします。"
msgstr ""
"Choose what counts as one sample. {pixel} is one skeleton pixel, {kink} "
"is one kink, {fiber} is one fiber (height uses the median within that "
"fiber), {image} is one image, and {folder} is one registered folder. "
"{image} and {folder} take the median of the fiber values they hold; for "
"kink angle, the median of all their kink angles, and for kink density, "
"the total kink count divided by the total judged length. A distribution "
"pooled over {pixel} is not a set of independent observations and weighs "
"longer fibers more heavily, so also check {fiber}, {image} or {folder} "
"when comparing groups. If each folder holds one specimen, {folder} is the"
" unit that tests a difference between specimens. {length} weights each "
"skeleton pixel by contour length. Counting pixels equally carries two "
"biases: diagonal skeleton steps are about 1.41x longer than orthogonal "
"ones, and the pixel size changes with the scan size across images. "
"{length} removes both and gives a scan-independent distribution — the "
"fraction of observed contour length at each value."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1603
msgid "図"
msgstr "Plot"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1613
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{histogram} は 1 群の分布の形を示します。{ecdf} は累積分布を重ねて描くため、ビン幅に依存せずに群を比較できます。{box} "
"は各群の中央値と四分位数を並べて要約します。{ecdf} と {box} は常に重ね／並置表示になるため、縦並び・重ね表示の選択は使われません。"
msgstr ""
"{histogram} shows the shape of one group's distribution. {ecdf} overlays "
"the cumulative distributions, so groups can be compared without depending"
" on a bin width. {box} summarises each group's median and quartiles side "
"by side. {ecdf} and {box} always place every group on one axes, so the "
"stacked/overlaid choice is unused."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1619
msgid "曲率窓"
msgstr "Curvature window"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1633
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{curvature} "
"が回転角を測る弧長です。骨格のステップは直交か斜めしか無いため画素スケールでは方向が量子化され、窓が小さすぎると真の曲率に関係なく一定のノイズ値が返ります（既知半径の円弧に対し"
" 20 nm では常に 19.4 rad/{um} でした）。大きくすると滑らかになりますが、窓より短いファイバーは測定対象から外れます。"
msgstr ""
"The arc length {curvature} turns over. Skeleton steps are only orthogonal"
" or diagonal, so direction is quantised at the pixel scale and too small "
"a window returns a constant noise value whatever the true curvature "
"(against arcs of known radius, 20 nm always gave 19.4 rad/{um}). A larger"
" window smooths the estimate but excludes every fiber shorter than it."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1640
msgid "枠のファイバー"
msgstr "Fibers at frame"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1651
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{length} だけに効く設定です。画像の枠に達したファイバーは走査範囲の外へ続いているため、長さが短く測られます。{include} "
"はそのまま集計し、{exclude} "
"は長さの集計から外します。ただし長いファイバーほど枠に達しやすいため、外すだけでは長いファイバーが過小になります。{ml} "
"は外したうえで、残った各ファイバーを枠内に収まる確率の逆数で重み付けし（Miles-Lantuejoul "
"補正）、その偏りを補正します。重み付きの標本には群間検定を行いません。交差で切れた断片は補正されず、その本数はログに出ます。高さ・曲率・キンクは枠内の部分の測定として有効なため、この設定の影響を受けません。"
msgstr ""
"Applies to {length} only. A fiber that reaches the image frame continues "
"outside the scan, so its length is measured short. {include} aggregates "
"such fibers as they are, and {exclude} leaves them out of the length "
"statistics. A long fiber is more likely to reach the frame, however, so "
"leaving them out alone under-represents long fibers. {ml} leaves them out"
" and weights each remaining fiber by the inverse of its chance of fitting"
" inside the frame (the Miles-Lantuejoul correction), which removes that "
"bias. Weighted samples are not tested between groups. Fragments cut at a "
"crossing are not corrected; the log reports how many there are. Height, "
"curvature and kinks remain valid measurements of the part inside the "
"frame, so this setting does not affect them."

