msgstr " (the rest are aggregated as skeleton fragments)"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:3623
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"[{grp}/{folder}] {n}/{total} バンドルは旧版（形式 "
"1.0）で解析されています。保存されたスケルトンをそのまま追跡してスケルトンに沿って計測するため、現在の解析が取り除く小ループや行き止まりの短い枝でファイバーが分断されていることがあります。GUI01"
" で再解析してください"
msgstr ""
"[{grp}/{folder}] {n}/{total} bundles were analyzed by an earlier version "
"(format 1.0). Their stored skeletons are traced as they are and measured "
"along the skeleton, so fibers may be split at small loops and short dead-"
"end branches that the current analysis removes. Re-analyze them in GUI01"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:3641
