"[{grp}/{folder}] Length: excluded {n}/{total} fibers that reach the "
"frame. Of the rest, {k} have an end cut at a crossing or similar, so "
"their length is a lower bound"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:3722
