"[{grp}] With only {n} samples the histogram shape cannot be read; use the"
" median and IQR in the table."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:3900
msgid "比較には 2 群以上が必要です。"
msgstr "A comparison needs at least two groups."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:3903
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{unit} 集計の標本は独立観測ではないため検定しません。{fiber}・{image}・{folder} のいずれかの集計に切り替えてください。"
msgstr ""
"Samples aggregated per {unit} are not independent observations, so they "
"are not tested. Switch to the {fiber}, {image} or {folder} unit."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:3914
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{ml} 補正の標本は重み付きのため検定しません。検定するには {exclude} に切り替えてください。"
