msgstr ""
"Number of skeleton points trimmed from around the junction before "
"connecting."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7205
msgid "継ぎ目の折れもキンクとして判定する"
msgstr "Judge bends at bridges as kinks too"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7210
msgid ""
"連結した継ぎ目（繊維が見えていない隙間を直線でつないだ部分）にかかる折れを、キンクとして判定するかどうか。外すと、それらの折れは判定せず、個別表示のウインドウと"
" AFM "
"全体像にマゼンタの白抜きの菱形で表示し、キンク数にもキンク密度にも数えません。どちらの場合も、継ぎ目そのものの長さはキンク密度の分母に含めません。形式"
" 1.0 のバンドルでは、この設定は効きません。"
msgstr ""
"Whether bends at a connection bridge (the straight segment drawn across a"
" gap where no fiber is visible) are judged as kinks. When unchecked, such"
" bends are not judged: the Individual View window and the AFM Overview "
"show them as hollow magenta diamonds, and they are counted neither in the"
" kink count nor in the kink density. Either way, the length of the bridge"
" itself is not included in the kink density's divisor. This setting has "
"no effect on a format 1.0 bundle."

